Article 9 (Lending of Materials)
(1) Library materials may be lent where any of the following applies:
1. Where lending is necessary for cooperation with another library, including interlibrary loans (meaning the exchange of materials between libraries);
2. Where lending is necessary for a public official to perform official duties;
3. In other cases where the Director deems lending necessary.
(2) The scope of Library materials that may be lent under paragraph (1) shall be determined by the Director.
